# Enemy thinking / AI / action routines, ported from p_enemy.c to Flow.
#
# Action pointers (A_*) and P_NoiseAlert / PIT_VileCheck keep exact C names
# via @flow_api (info.c / P_BlockThingsIterator). Private helpers use the
# enemy_* prefix. Engine structs stay C-owned; field access goes through
# MOBJ_* / GEOM_* / spec APIs.
#
# Collision scratch: MAP_* (map.flow) and MAPUTL_openrange (maputl.flow).
# ENEMY_* consts avoid colliding with MAP_* / MAPUTL_*.
#
# LP64 offsetof notes (same as sight.flow):
#   mobj_t 224: x24 y28 z32 angle56 subsector88 floorz96 height108
#     momx112 momy116 momz120 type128 info136 tics144 state152 flags160
#     health164 movedir168 movecount172 target176 reactiontime184
#     threshold188 lastlook200 tracer216
#   sector_t 128: soundtraversed20 soundtarget24 validcount88 linecount112 lines120
#   line_t 88: flags24 sidenum30 tag28

